# SOTA Calendar Builder — Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env for local development.
# On Render, set these in the Environment tab of your service.

# ── Optional tuning ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# How long (seconds) to cache the raw SOTA alerts list in memory.
# Default: 1800 (30 minutes). Lower values hit the SOTA API more frequently.
CACHE_TTL=1800

# ── No API keys required ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This app only uses the public SOTA Alerts API (https://api2.sota.org.uk/api).
# No authentication or API keys are needed for the web calendar builder.
#
# If you are also running sota_calendar.py (the Pi-based Google Calendar sync),
# that script requires a Google service account key file — see SETUP.md.
